============================== FONTS ==============================

Fonts are not part of U8G2GL and are not covered by the licence above.
U8G2GL compiles or references fonts; it does not supply them.

Fonts bundled with U8G2 (referenced via <builtin>) remain under U8G2's
own terms. U8G2GL emits a reference to a symbol that U8G2 already
provides -- no font data is copied or redistributed by U8G2GL. For the
licensing conditions of each U8G2 font group, see:

	https://github.com/olikraus/u8g2/wiki/fntgrp

Fonts you supply yourself (referenced via <bdf>) remain yours, under
whatever terms they carry. Compiling them into your firmware is your
decision and your responsibility.
